{"id":338,"mal_id":338,"title":"Versailles no Bara","englishTitle":"The Rose of Versailles","title_english":"The Rose of Versailles","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Berusaiyu no Bara"],"en":"The Rose of Versailles","ja":"ベルサイユのばら"},"synopsis":"In a time of class stratification and rising tensions amongst the impoverished population, the Austrian Empire sends Princess Marie Antoinette to France to be wed to Crown Prince Louis XVI. The political marriage is arranged to strengthen the alliance between both countries, but the future queen is deeply unsatisfied with her fate being decided for her. Upon arrival in the country, Marie Antoinette is acquainted with Oscar Fançois de Jarjayes—Commander of the Royal Guard.\n\nDue to her father's desire for a son, Oscar is raised as a boy with an expectation to inherit his title as The Commander. Though she is revered by both men and women alike, Oscar cannot help but desire to live life as a woman instead of masquerading as a man. As Oscar reluctantly serves the young, spoiled queen, the growing resentment and suffering of the poor become harder for her to ignore—especially when Marie Antoinette frivolously spends her wealth.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\n","synopsis_es":"En una época de estratificación de clases y crecientes tensiones entre la población empobrecida, el Imperio austríaco envía a la princesa María Antonieta a Francia para casarse con el príncipe heredero Luis XVI. El matrimonio político está concertado para fortalecer la alianza entre ambos países, pero la futura reina está profundamente insatisfecha con el hecho de que su destino se decida por ella. Al llegar al país, María Antonieta conoce a Oscar Fançois de Jarjayes, comandante de la Guardia Real.\n\nDebido al deseo de su padre de tener un hijo, Oscar es criado como un niño con la expectativa de heredar su título de Comandante. Aunque es venerada tanto por hombres como por mujeres, Oscar no puede evitar desear vivir la vida como una mujer en lugar de hacerse pasar por un hombre. Mientras Oscar sirve a regañadientes a la joven y malcriada reina, el creciente resentimiento y el sufrimiento de los pobres se vuelven más difíciles de ignorar para ella, especialmente cuando María Antonieta gasta frívolamente su riqueza.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1465,"average_episode_duration":1465,"startDate":"1979-10-10","start_date":"1979-10-10","endDate":"1980-09-03","end_date":"1980-09-03","season":"fall","year":1979,"start_season":{"year":1979,"season":"fall"},"episodes":40,"num_episodes":40,"score":8.36,"mean":8.36,"numListUsers":118363,"num_list_users":118363,"genres":[{"id":81,"name":"Crossdressing"},{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":13,"name":"Historical"},{"id":38,"name":"Military"},{"id":22,"name":"Romance"},{"id":25,"name":"Shoujo"}],"studios":[{"id":65,"name":"Tokyo Movie Shinsha"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/57043.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/57043l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/57043.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/57043l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/57043l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"wednesday","time":"19:00","day_of_the_week":"wednesday","start_time":"19:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"wednesday 19:00"},"rank":280,"popularity":2193,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":34925,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2005-11-20T02:53:18+00:00","updated_at":"2024-11-08T02:15:40+00:00","source":"manga","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":3868,"title":"Versailles no Bara: Seimei Aru Kagiri Aishite","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anim